{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b7d4bdb0-48a3-8bc4-804b-ea3ad2289fa3",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T12:15:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gino Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:12:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:12:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Gino Ricci. I'm on Bliss Road. My recycling bin is cracked. Lid's gone too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:12:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. What's the address there, Mr. Ricci?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:12:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "159 Bliss Road. Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:12:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 159 Bliss. So what happened to the bin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:12:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Truck guy tossed it. Cracked down the side. Wind took the lid. I found it two yards over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:12:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it the recycling bin or the trash barrel that's damaged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:12:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recycling. The blue one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:12:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I can put in a replacement request for you. Is the bin cracked all the way through, or just the lid missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:13:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. Bin's cracked. Lid's gone. It's no use to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:13:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So how do I request one, you're asking? You just did. I'll enter it now. I'll need a phone number in case the crew has a question."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:13:22-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:13:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, 401-555-0162. And you can leave the broken one at the curb so they can swap it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:13:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave the old one out. Fine. How long does it take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:13:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually within a week or so, sometimes a little longer. It depends on what they have on the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:13:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Another thing. What's the schedule now? After the holiday week. Mine got thrown off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:13:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. The holiday week pushed pickups back a day, but that's done now. Your schedule should be back to your regular day. Is your regular day Thursday, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:14:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. Trash Thursday. Recycling every other week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:14:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So you're back on Thursday. For recycling, which week is it, you want to know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:14:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. When's the next one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:14:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up your route. [pause] Okay, that's showing recycling this coming Thursday, so tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:14:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. And I got no bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:14:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. For tomorrow, put your recycling out in a sturdy box or a bag, something open on top, and mark it recycling. They'll take it. Don't wait on the new bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:14:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cardboard box. Okay. I can do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:14:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works fine. And I'll note the cracked bin so they know it's not you who broke it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:14:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's not me. Eleven years I've had that bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:14:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Noted. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:14:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. I'm heading out after this. Got to stop at the hardware store for one bolt. Gate latch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:15:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good luck finding the right one. They always have a million sizes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:15:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Bring the old one with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:15:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart. Alright, Mr. Ricci, your request is in for 159 Bliss Road. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:15:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. You too."
    }
  ],
